{"lyrics":"[Intro: Gunna]\n[00:13.06]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[00:14.54](Playmakers)\n[00:15.16]Uh (Run that back, Turbo)\n[Chorus: Gunna]\n[00:16.02]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[00:16.80]Paranoia, all this money on my brain (Brain)\n[00:18.14]Guess it's more (More), a young boss, so I'm rockin' a plain (Plain)\n[00:22.02]Foreign cars, two-door coupe, executive Range, yeah\n[Verse 1: Gunna]\n[00:26.34]Check the stats, I'm on the charts\n[00:27.86]Nigga be trippin' 'bout a broad, need to stop takin' shit to the heart\n[00:31.44]You can win a bitch-nigga award\n[00:33.08]I'm a real nigga and they already know it\n[00:34.68]I'ma speak to these bitches like a poet (Poet)\n[00:36.04]Ain't no cappin', I was trappin' off the porch\n[00:37.92]Now I'm rappin', I can pull up in a Porsche\n[00:39.70]I cashed out a check for my voice (Voice)\n[00:41.16]Had to get it, they ain't leave me no choice (Nah)\n[00:42.90]I hit it and leave shit moist (Moist)\n[00:44.44]I done really started shoppin' in Nordstrom\n[00:46.02]These bitches really want 'em a portion\n[00:47.56]Since mine had to pay for abortion (Abortion)\n[00:49.32]On the grind, I'ma stay up 'till the mornin' (Mornin')\n[00:50.88]Board a jet with a cup full of barney\n[Chorus: Gunna & Juice WRLD]\n[00:52.12]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[00:54.32]Paranoia, all this money on my brain (Brain)\n[00:57.06]Guess it's more (More), a young boss, so I'm rockin' a plain (Plain)\n[01:00.78]Foreign cars, two-door coupe, executive Range\n[01:04.92]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[01:07.30]Paranoia, all this money on my brain (Brain)\n[01:10.56]Guess it's more (More), a young boss, so I'm rockin' a plain (Plain)\n[01:13.92]Foreign cars, two-door coupe, executive Range (\n[01:16.62]Uh\n[01:16.66])\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:17.84]Two-door coupe (Skrrt), drop the roof (Yeah)\n[01:19.66]This a Transformer too (Yeah)\n[01:21.12]I'm in my bag, ain't nothin' new\n[01:22.72]Been in my bag since high school (Ya dig?)\n[01:24.28]Choppa talk, Dr. Seuss (Uh-huh, grrah)\n[01:25.90]Catch a nigga, grab the noose (Uh-huh, grrah)\n[01:27.60]Your bitch look so edible (Uh)\n[01:28.34]I'ma take her for dinner (Yeah)\n[01:29.04]Hop in that bitch like I'm incredible (Yeah, bitch)\n[01:31.00]I fuck that bitch like a winner (Uh)\n[01:33.48]Feel like Mike Tyson, I'm impeccable (Ya dig?)\n[01:38.02]Uh, I don't love her, nah\n[01:41.28]I only love my Beretta, ho (Ya dig? Uh-huh)\n[01:49.68]I still get her wetter though (Still get her wet)\n[01:51.70]Bill Cosby, Molly on me (Haha)\n[01:54.10]Damn it, Gucci my sweater, ho (Gang, Gucci my sweater)\n[Chorus: Gunna]\n[01:56.84]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[01:59.18]Paranoia, all this money on my brain (Brain)\n[02:01.92]Guess it's more (More), a young boss, so I'm rockin' a plain (Plain)\n[02:05.66]Foreign cars, two-door coupe, executive Range\n[02:08.58]Only time I sleep is on a plane\n[02:30.62]Paranoia, all this money on my brain (Brain)\n[02:31.82]Guess it's more (More), a young boss, so I'm rockin' a plain (Plain)\n[02:33.86]Foreign cars, two-door coupe, executive Range","words":[[13.06,13.2,"Only"],[13.34,13.6,"time"],[13.66,13.66,"I"],[13.74,13.98,"sleep"],[14.04,14.16,"is"],[14.24,14.28,"on"],[14.32,14.32,"a"],[14.38,14.5,"plane"],[14.54,15.12,"(Playmakers)"],[15.16,15.22,"Uh"],[15.28,15.36,"(Run"],[15.4,15.56,"that"],[15.6,15.72,"back,"],[15.76,15.9,"Turbo)"],[16.02,16.08,"Only"],[16.14,16.24,"time"],[16.28,16.28,"I"],[16.32,16.44,"sleep"],[16.5,16.52,"is"],[16.56,16.58,"on"],[16.62,16.62,"a"],[16.66,16.76,"plane"],[16.8,17.04,"Paranoia,"],[17.1,17.16,"all"],[17.22,17.3,"this"],[17.34,17.42,"money"],[17.48,17.5,"on"],[17.54,17.56,"my"],[17.6,17.72,"brain"],[17.82,18.1,"(Brain)"],[18.14,18.82,"Guess"],[18.86,18.96,"it's"],[19.06,19.18,"more"],[19.22,19.28,"(More),"],[19.92,19.92,"a"],[20.02,20.2,"young"],[20.28,20.4,"boss,"],[20.44,20.5,"so"],[20.54,20.58,"I'm"],[20.68,20.84,"rockin'"],[20.9,20.9,"a"],[21.04,21.34,"plain"],[21.88,21.98,"(Plain)"]